{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"晨早新聞重點｜美國中期選舉東岸州份票站陸續關閉／巴基斯坦成功試射國產空對空導彈\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/H-US-VOTE-261104A.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】11月4日now早晨新聞重點</p><p>【投票將結束】美國中期選舉東岸州份的票站將陸續關閉。</p><p>【成功試射】巴基斯坦宣布成功試射首枚國產空對空導彈。</p><p>【見俄烏代表】美國第一夫人梅拉尼婭將會在白宮接見俄烏代表。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T23:41:29.614891+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":106,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T23:19:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T10:18:33.891814+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T23:38:36.833329+00:00","content_hash":"903b7f2210073397b9b6f752e49e6ddbea341d3afc06747c39b07d5f27439fbf","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T23:41:29.614891+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}